{title: Boundless Love}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

>Lyrics

Righteous, holy, boundless in glory,

Praise to the Lord!

Unto Him all nations of earth shall bow.

Everlasting Truth of the ages,

He is the Lord,

His mercy flows to all who receive Him now.

One day soon, He promises,

He's coming again,

All who trust His Word shall inherit

Life without end.

One day soon, He promises,

He's coming again,

And we shall reign with Him for eternity!

The Lord our God

Came to earth,

And suffered for our sin.

He opened wide

The gates of heav'n

That we may enter in!

(Guitar solo)

Righteous, holy, boundless in glory,

Praise to the Lord!

Angels join the chorus, and with us sing:

From everlasting to everlasting,

He is the Lord:

Redeemer, Master, Counselor, mighty King!

Boundless love He showed on the cross

To pay for my sin,

Boundless love that took my disgrace

And called me a friend.

One day soon, He promises,

He's coming again,

And we shall reign with Him for eternity!

The Lord our God

Came to earth,

And suffered for our sin.

He opened wide

The gates of heav'n

That we may enter in!

The Lord our God

Came to earth,

And suffered for our sin.

He opened wide

The gates of heav'n

That we may enter in!
